            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nTop price - quality sushi restaurant in Hanoi\nMar 2022 • Friends\nGenerally speaking I found the fish in all sushi restaurants less fresh than in HCMC while pricier, which is understandable as this is an inland city. But among all sushi places I visited in Hanoi, this is among the top for its price to quality (a next door sushi restaurant has the same quality but almost double the price)\nWritten March 6, 2022",
