            "review_title": "Review at Sushi 24",
            "review_text": "Paul C\nDún Laoghaire, Ireland26 contributions\n0\nGreat sushi if you live around Ba Dinh\nMar 2020\nI used to teach near Kim Ma street and sushi 24 was only a few hundred meters from the school. I would come here on Fridays and enjoy the salmon sashimi, Sapporo and some miso soup. Recommended for those who want to have a tastier sushi than the chain restaurants, and its quiet interior makes it ideal for dates as well. A lovely experience to unwind after a long week.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 26, 2020",
