            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nSushi 24 Has Moved - Still Great!\nMar 2019 • Solo\nThis is the new address for Sushi 24. It used to get very good reviews at its old location. It's now located on Kim Ma. They offer great value set menus at lunch time (and I believe dinner too). The food is prepared hot and fresh - or cold and fresh if it's sushi! The service is fast and friendly and the prices are quite reasonable. This was my first visit and I was made to feel at home right away. And, the fact that they have free WIFI and take credit cards is a bonus. I'll absolutely be back.\n\nMy pork curry lunch set was delicious and more than I could eat...and a great value at 89,000 dong!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
